						 <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>I always thought I might be bad</strong></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Now I'm sure that it's true</strong></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>'Cause I think you're so good</strong></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>And I'm nothing like you</strong></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><strong>-&quot;Love Like You&quot;, by Rebecca Sugar</strong></p> </div> </blockquote> <p>This is my first article, I hope you all enjoy! If not I apologise for the time lost. Any of your thoughts on it would be appreciated!<br /> A big thanks for idea crit to: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flopmind" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6407594&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="Flopmind" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6407594)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flopmind" >Flopmind</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duhon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6597379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="Duhon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6597379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duhon" >Duhon</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/comrade-waldo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6123043&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="Comrade Waldo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6123043)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/comrade-waldo" >Comrade Waldo</a></span><br /> Thanks for draft crit: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2104082&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="ManyMeats" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2104082)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats" >ManyMeats</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barheru" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6691112&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="Barheru" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6691112)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barheru" >Barheru</a></span><br /> A big thanks to: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6104981&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="OCuin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6104981)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" >OCuin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sonderance" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6091992&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="Sonderance" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6091992)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sonderance" >Sonderance</a></span> for help with both!</p> 
				 	]]>
